    <briefdescription>
<para>Runtime-defined layout for a flat array of named <computeroutput>double</computeroutput> state variables. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Variables are registered by name and size via <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_utilities_1_1_state_layout_dynamic_1a6e32061b7fab4dff106fc06b691b19a0" kindref="member">add()</ref>, then the layout is locked with <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_utilities_1_1_state_layout_dynamic_1a56fa3f8c6e2cb53496632ace4df3033f" kindref="member">finalize()</ref>, which assigns contiguous offsets. After finalization the various <computeroutput>get*</computeroutput> accessors can be used to reach individual variables inside any conforming state vector. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
